    <div class="prose">
      <p>Ofir Omer, Adv. (practicing since 2013) advises companies, business owners, and private clients on legal counsel and civil-commercial litigation. We handle complex disputes and matters with significant business and legal implications, combining deep legal knowledge, business understanding, and strategic thinking.</p>
      <p>The professional approach is based on risk-benefit analysis, full alignment of expectations with the client, and an understanding of the economic implications of every legal step. Quality representation, in our view, requires a broad view of the complete picture — legal, business, and human — not just a specific answer to the legal question.</p>
      <p>We represent companies from diverse sectors, including malls and shopping centers, fashion and retail companies, software houses, management companies, financial entities, and private clients. Every case involves personal involvement, high availability, and complete discretion — driven by a commitment to creating precise, stable, and trust-based solutions.</p>
